          "body": "<style>\n:root {--bg: #F8F6F0;--text: #2C1A1D;--primary: #6B1D2F;--accent: #A3485E;--card-bg: #FFFFFF;--border: #D3C5C7}\n* {box-sizing: border-box;margin: 0;padding: 0}\nbody {background-color: var(--bg);color: var(--text);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6}\nmain {display: block}\n.hero-band {background-color: var(--primary);color: #F8F6F0;padding: 6rem 2rem 5rem 2rem;text-align: center;position: relative}\n.hero-band h1 {font-size: 3.5rem;font-weight: 800;letter-spacing: -0.05em;margin-bottom: 1.5rem}\n.hero-band p {font-size: 1.25rem;max-width: 600px;margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;opacity: 0.9}\n.hero-links {display: flex;justify-content: center;gap: 1.5rem;flex-wrap: wrap}\n.hero-links a {background-color: #F8F6F0;color: var(--primary);padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;text-decoration: none;font-weight: 600;border-radius: 4px;transition: opacity 0.2s}\n.hero-links a:hover {opacity: 0.9}\n\n.section-band {padding: 5rem 2rem;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border)}\n.section-band:nth-child(even) {background-color: #F2EFE9}\n.container {max-width: 1000px;margin: 0 auto}\nh2 {font-size: 2.25rem;margin-bottom: 1rem;color: var(--primary);font-weight: 700}\n.section-desc {font-size: 1.1rem;margin-bottom: 3rem;opacity: 0.8}\n\n.grid-features {display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap: 2rem}\n.ticket-card {border: 2px dashed var(--border);background-color: var(--card-bg);padding: 2.5rem 2rem;position: relative}\n.ticket-card h3 {font-size: 1.35rem;margin-bottom: 1rem;color: var(--primary)}\n.ticket-card p {font-size: 0.95rem;opacity: 0.85}\n\n.plans-staircase {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 2rem}\n.plan-step {border: 2px dashed var(--border);background-color: var(--card-bg);padding: 2.5rem;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.5rem}\n.plan-step:nth-child(1) {margin-left: 0}\n.plan-step:nth-child(2) {margin-left: 1.5rem;border-color: var(--primary)}\n.plan-step:nth-child(3) {margin-left: 3rem}\n@media(max-width: 768px) {\n  .plan-step {margin-left: 0 !important}\n}\n.plan-header {display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: baseline;flex-wrap: wrap;gap: 1rem;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom: 1.5rem}\n.plan-name {font-size: 1.5rem;font-weight: 700;color: var(--primary)}\n.plan-pricing {text-align: right}\n.price-main {font-size: 1.5rem;font-weight: 800}\n.price-sub {font-size: 0.85rem;opacity: 0.7}\n.plan-features {list-style: none;display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));gap: 0.75rem}\n.plan-features li {font-size: 0.95rem;opacity: 0.9;position: relative;padding-left: 1.25rem}\n.plan-features li::before {content: \"-\";position: absolute;left: 0;color: var(--accent);font-weight: bold}\n.plan-action {align-self: flex-start;background-color: var(--primary);color: #F8F6F0;padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;text-decoration: none;font-weight: 600;border-radius: 4px}\n\n.faq-groups {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 3rem}\n.faq-group h3 {font-size: 1.3rem;margin-bottom: 1.25rem;color: var(--accent);border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom: 0.5rem}\n.faq-item {background-color: var(--card-bg);border: 2px dashed var(--border);padding: 1.5rem;margin-bottom: 1rem}\n.faq-item h4 {font-size: 1.05rem;margin-bottom: 0.75rem;color: var(--primary)}\n.faq-item p {font-size: 0.95rem;opacity: 0.85}\n\nfooter {background-color: var(--primary);color: #F8F6F0;text-align: center;padding: 3rem 2rem;font-size: 0.9rem}\nfooter p {opacity: 0.8}\n</style><main>\n  \n  <section class=\"hero-band\">\n    <h1>Shadowfly</h1>\n    <p>构建稳定、高效、秩序井然的网络连接体验。提供清晰的套餐结构、透明的服务条款与全方位的技术支持。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-links\">\n      <a href=\"#plans\">查看套餐</a>\n      <a href=\"#features\">核心优势</a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"section-band\" id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>服务核心优势</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">我们通过务实的技术架构，确保您的每一次网络访问都顺畅无阻。</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"grid-features\">\n        <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n          <h3>多端设备同步</h3>\n          <p>支持主流操作系统与各类终端设备。单账号即可满足多台设备同时在线连接的需求，无需重复配置。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n          <h3>极速大容量流量</h3>\n          <p>提供充足的高速流量配额，满足日常网页浏览、大文件传输与高清多媒体播放等多种场景。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n          <h3>稳定节点矩阵</h3>\n          <p>持续优化的节点池与专线网络布局，保障连接持久稳定，有效减少波动与延迟。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"section-band\" id=\"plans\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>服务套餐配置</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">按需选择合适的流量与设备配额，所有套餐均可享受基础保障服务。</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"plans-staircase\">\n        \n        <div class=\"plan-step\">\n          <div class=\"plan-header\">\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"plan-name\">基础版</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n              <div class=\"price-main\">¥15/月</div>\n              <div class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"plan-action\" href=\"#\">选择基础版</a>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"plan-step\">\n          <div class=\"plan-header\">\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版 (推荐)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n              <div class=\"price-main\">¥35/月</div>\n              <div class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n            <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n            <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"plan-action\" href=\"#\">选择旗舰版</a>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"plan-step\">\n          <div class=\"plan-header\">\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"plan-name\">团队版</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n              <div class=\"price-main\">¥85/月</div>\n              <div class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n            <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n            <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"plan-action\" href=\"#\">选择团队版</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"section-band\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>常见问题与解答</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">在这里查找关于账号、连接与套餐配置的实用说明。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-groups\">\n        \n        <div class=\"faq-group\">\n          <h3>账号与连接</h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            404\n            <p>每个套餐均明确规定了允许同时在线的最大设备数量。若超出限制，较早连接的设备可能会自动断开，建议根据实际需求选择对应套餐。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>流量是如何计算与重置的？</h4>\n            <p>流量采用自然月结算或按购买周期重置。套餐内包含的极速流量在每个计费周期开始时自动恢复至满额。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"faq-group\">\n          <h3>技术与支持</h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>如何获取客户端与配置订阅？</h4>\n            <p>购买套餐后，您可在用户中心查看详细的使用说明文档，并获取专属的订阅链接导入至各平台兼容客户端中。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>遇到连接不稳定时该如何处理？</h4>\n            <p>请首先检查本地网络环境，尝试切换至其他可用节点。如问题持续存在，可通过工单系统联系技术支持获取协助。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <p>© Shadowfly. 保留所有权利。提供稳定高效的网络连接服务。</p>\n</footer>",
